        },
        {
          "text": "“Ne enju eye lukoosi lukali luno, buli mundu olakibirao aliuka mala aboole ali, ‘Siina sikila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne akhola ario khu sibala sino, ne khu nju khulwe?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
