          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio baliboola bali, ‘Sikila banjukha Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owe bakuuka babwe owabarusia abareera khukhwama mu sibala sia Misiri, mala batiilile bawele babaandi ne khubasaaya ne khubakholela. Khwako Wele abareereere butinyu buno bwoosi.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.22",
